Here are my findings for how "telephone" is handled across owners/pets/vets in `/home/daniel/sandbox`.

## 1. Java files referencing "telephone"

### Entity: `Owner`
`/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/model/Owner.java`
```java
46	    @Column(name = "telephone")
47	    @NotEmpty
