123	    o.put("telephone", uniqueTelephone());
172	// comment: "each owner differs in name/address/telephone so only the city count accumulates."
```
Important: `telephoneDisplay` does not exist anywhere except this test — it is not in the OpenAPI spec, `OwnerDto`, the `Owner` entity, or the mapper. The test currently expects a field that the implementation does not yet produce.

## 4. Build system and running tests

- Build system: Maven. Build file: `/home/daniel/sandbox/pom.xml` (`org.springframework.samples:spring-petclinic-rest`). Wrapper present: `/home/daniel/sandbox/mvnw` and `mvnw.cmd`.
- DTOs are generated by the `openapi-generator-maven-plugin` (pom.xml lines ~368–412) from `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/resources/openapi.yml`, with `modelNameSuffix=Dto`, `modelPackage=org.springframework.samples.petclinic.rest.dto`. So `OwnerDto` is generated, not hand-written.
- Run tests: `./mvnw test` (unit) or `./mvnw verify`. Run just the acceptance test: `./mvnw test -Dtest=AcceptanceTest`.

## 5. Phone-number formatting utility / libphonenumber dependency

There is no libphonenumber (or any `phone` dependency) in `pom.xml` — `grep -in "phone" pom.xml` returns nothing. The only phone formatting/normalization logic is the hand-rolled `OwnerTelephone.toE164(...)` described in item 1. There is currently no "display formatting" helper (nothing that produces `"+61 412 345 678"` with grouped spaces) — only E.164 normalization exists.

## 6. Directory structure (owner package and DTO/response packages)

DTOs are generated, so there is no `dto` package under `src/main/java`; the source packages relevant to owners/responses are:

```
src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/
├── model/                    (Owner.java, Pet.java, Vet.java, ... entities)
├── mapper/                   (OwnerMapper.java, PetMapper.java, VetMapper.java, ...)
├── util/                     (OwnerIdentities.java, MembershipLevels, Localities, ContactPreferences, AgeBands, CheckDigits)
├── repository/
│   ├── jdbc/  jpa/  springdatajpa/
├── rest/
│   ├── escalation/           (InvalidTelephoneException.java, InvalidTelephoneExceptionHandler.java, ...)
│   ├── validation/
│   └── function/
│       ├── owner/            <-- owner package
│       │     OwnerTelephone.java, ValidateOwner.java, ValidateOwnerFields.java,
│       │     ApplyOwner.java, AssignCustomerCode.java, CheckPossibleDuplicate.java,
│       │     RespondWithOwner.java, RespondWithOwnerCreated.java, RespondWithOwnerUpdated.java,
│       │     ListOwners.java, ListOwnersPage.java, HouseholdMembers.java
│       ├── pet/  vet/  visit/  pettype/  specialty/  user/  root/  common/
